        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Plants: Chengiopanax sciadophylloides, Hippeastrum puniceum\n- Genera: the former genus of Chengiopanax sciadophylloides, the genus of another flowering bulb plant\n\nFacts:\n- Chengiopanax sciadophylloides was previously included in another genus before being placed in Chengiopanax.\n- Another flowering bulb plant belongs to a genus that is not the genus of Hippeastrum puniceum.\n- Hippeastrum puniceum is not a species of that flowering bulb plant genus.",
